From 8472938472938472938472938472938472938472 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gemini <gemini@localhost>
Date: Fri, 30 Jan 2026 14:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] rk3568-evb: Add missing pinctrl to uart2 for console

The default rk3568-evb device tree lacks pinctrl properties for uart2,
which is the default console. This causes the UART TX pin to remain
unconfigured.

Additionally, mark the pinctrl node as essential for U-Boot/SPL so
it doesn't get stripped by fdtgrep.

Upstream-Status: Pending

Signed-off-by: Gemini <gemini@localhost>
---
 arch/arm/dts/rk3568-evb.dts | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm/dts/rk3568-evb.dts b/arch/arm/dts/rk3568-evb.dts
index 1234567..89abcdef 100644
--- a/arch/arm/dts/rk3568-evb.dts
+++ b/arch/arm/dts/rk3568-evb.dts
@@ -100,4 +100,10 @@
 
 &uart2 {
 	status = "okay";
+	pinctrl-names = "default";
+	pinctrl-0 = <&uart2m0_xfer>;
+};
+
+&uart2m0_xfer {
+	u-boot,dm-spl;
 };
-- 
